\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8.2}{\ignorespaces SFT training pipeline for critic models. Based on our analysis (\S  \ref {critic:sec:critique_design}), the critic contains error detection, budget planning, and only provides high-level feedback instead of concrete actions. We run the frozen coding agent $\pi _A$ on disjoint training tasks and query the teacher critic $C_T$ every $k$ steps. We collect (trajectory prefix, feedback) pairs $(z_t, f_t^*)$ to train a critic $C_\theta $ by supervised fine-tuning (SFT).\relax }}{102}{figure.caption.70}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{critic:fig:training}{{8.2}{102}{SFT training pipeline for critic models. Based on our analysis (\S \ref {critic:sec:critique_design}), the critic contains error detection, budget planning, and only provides high-level feedback instead of concrete actions. We run the frozen coding agent $\pi _A$ on disjoint training tasks and query the teacher critic $C_T$ every $k$ steps. We collect (trajectory prefix, feedback) pairs $(z_t, f_t^*)$ to train a critic $C_\theta $ by supervised fine-tuning (SFT).\relax }{figure.caption.70}{}}
\newlabel{critic:fig:training@cref}{{[figure][2][8]8.2}{[1][101][]102}}
